      <title>Cybertruck“脱落门”：6197辆车紧急召回，是交付阵痛还是质量警钟？</title>
      <link>https://johhhhnny.github.io/TeslaDaily/posts/20251031-cybertruck%E8%84%B1%E8%90%BD%E9%97%A86197%E8%BE%86%E8%BD%A6%E7%B4%A7%E6%80%A5%E5%8F%AC%E5%9B%9E%E6%98%AF%E4%BA%A4%E4%BB%98%E9%98%B5%E7%97%9B%E8%BF%98%E6%98%AF%E8%B4%A8%E9%87%8F%E8%AD%A6%E9%92%9F/</link>
